  -- HONEST READ --
    ROBUST correction WINS on held-out data: Q95 132.955 -> 113.550 kcal/mol (14.6% reduction). A real, disclosed win from introducing a GPi2 correction the standard pipeline never had, chosen to minimize variance across real calibration uncertainty rather than to match one nominal point exactly.
